# The state ledgers are append-only JSONL: when a run and a human (or two runs)
# both append and race to push, the right merge is always "keep both lines".
# Union merging makes that automatic during land.mjs's rebase, so a push race
# costs a retry, never a conflict prompt and never a lost record. Readers must
# not assume file order is chronological (state.mjs sorts by timestamp).
state/*.jsonl merge=union
reports/journal/*.md merge=union
